	(text "SUPPLY / ARMING\n4.5-12V Rail (after POWER switch SW201) -> SW103 ARM -> PowerRailControl\nSW103 open = ignition side unpowered\n(hardware interlock, independent of firmware)\nC104 2200µ buffers the firing current pulses\nThe 4.5-12V Rail (before ARM) also feeds MUX Supply of both banks"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3060fe14-b5c3-4f3d-a904-3ae5a55c68d0")
	)
	(text "CHANNEL DRIVERS 74HC595 (inside the channel banks)\nIO4 SER -> U501 (A) -> QH' -> U801 (B) -> QH' -> IO1\nIO1 = readback of the 16-bit chain\nSRCLK = IO3, RCLK = IO2 (both banks)\n/OE: Bank A = IO21 (R103), Bank B = IO47 (R104)\nR103/R104 10k pull-ups -> all outputs OFF during boot\nJP101: close ONLY if bank B is not fitted (8-CH build)\n-> IO1 then reads QH' of U501 directly"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.218 122.682 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "80689843-fb28-424c-9590-ccf13b7958f3")
	)
	(text "FIRING CHAIN\n1. POWER (SW201) and ARM (SW103) closed\n2. IO15 -> Q301 switches the Ignition Rail ON\n3. 74HC595 output n -> channel FET n fires igniter n\n   Bank A: U501 -> Q601-Q608 (CH1-8)\n   Bank B: U801 -> Q901-Q908 (CH9-16)\n\nCONTINUITY TEST: IO14 feeds 3.3 V via 1k into the rail,\nIO7 reads each channel via the ADC muxes \n	select IO11-IO13\n	/EN -> enable only one mux at a time\n		Bank A = IO6\n		Bank B = IO5 "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.894 62.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a15dbc15-39b2-42a8-bdba-163567986857")
	)
	(text "MCU U101 ESP32-S3-WROOM-1\nSW101 RESET: EN with RC R101/C103 (~10 ms power-on delay)\nSW102 BOOT: IO0 low at reset -> download mode, R102 pull-up\nC101 100n / C102 10µ: 3V3 decoupling + bulk at the module\nUSB D+/D- from J201 (ESD U202) -> native USB (flash + CDC)\nTP101-TP105 3V3, TP106-TP110 GND, TP111-TP118 IO10/17/18/38-42"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 172 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bc0d999c-b999-4267-81b7-9b6aaec3d507")
	)
	(text "GPIO MAP\nIO0   BOOT (SW102)\nIO1   Shift register chain readback\nIO2   74HC595 RCLK (both banks)\nIO3   74HC595 SRCLK (both banks)\nIO4   74HC595 SER (Bank A)\nIO5   Mux /EN Bank B\nIO6   Mux /EN Bank A\nIO7   Continuity mux output D (ADC1)\nIO8   Ignition rail voltage (ADC1)\nIO9   Battery voltage (ADC1)\nIO11/12/13  Mux select A2 / A1 / A0\nIO14  Rail test current ON\nIO15  Ignition rail ON\nIO16  WS2812B data\nIO19/20  USB D- / D+\nIO21  74HC595 /OE Bank A\nIO47  74HC595 /OE Bank B\nTest points: IO10, IO17, IO18, IO38-IO42\nFree: IO45, IO46, IO48, TXD0/RXD0\n(IO35-37 not usable with octal PSRAM)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 72.898 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ea33124a-c344-4dd8-a445-f42fe5c60067")
	)
	(text "CHANNEL BANKS (sheet channelBank, used twice)\nChannelBankA = CH1-8   (pages 5-7, refs 5xx/6xx/7xx)\nChannelBankB = CH9-16  (pages 8-10, refs 8xx/9xx/10xx)\nShared: SRCLK, RCLK, A0-A2, Data, Rail, MUX Supply, 3.3V\nPer bank: SER/chain, Channel Enable /OE, Sense Enable /EN\nBattery sense: Power Management sheet (IO9)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 107 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f4e4822c-7c3b-46b1-b461-401c0a8e0d3e")
	)
